<title>USA: Pharmacia seeks US clearance for Detrusitol.</title>
<headline>Pharmacia seeks US clearance for Detrusitol.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc said Wednesday it had has submitted a new drug application to the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for its Detrusitol tablets.</p>
<p>Detrusitol is intended for the treatment of certain types and symptons of urinary incontinence, the company said.</p>
</text>
